# Exhaustive power-loss and crash-image sweeps that the per-commit Linux attestation skips.
# Each one alone takes over a minute on linux,8c (measured 2026-11-01), and the slowest set the
# whole attestation's wall time to about 40 minutes. They still run in full once per merged
# batch: scripts/linux-preflight.sh runs every workspace unit test, and the native crash-harness
# lane runs broca-crash-harness.
